                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-5 items-stretch">
                    <div class="tile reveal !p-9 flex flex-col">
                        <h3 class="!text-2xl !font-bold" style="letter-spacing:-0.015em;">Free in your browser</h3>
                        <p class="mt-2 mb-7">Every feature, unlimited documents, works offline. No account, no catch.</p>
                        <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-2.5">
                            <a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/markdown-editor-for-chrom/dkpldbigkfcgpamifjimiejipmodkigk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="store-btn">
